# File capabilities for iputils (saphira-permissions V1).
#
# Least privilege by construction: ping and arping need raw sockets
# to do their job for ordinary users. Declared here instead of
# build-time setcap (the build uses -DNO_SETCAP_OR_SUID=true) so the
# authority survives in the package and converges at install/upgrade
# via the generated ensure-caps caller. No setuid anywhere.
cap /usr/bin/ping cap_net_raw+ep
cap /usr/bin/arping cap_net_raw+ep
